      {
        "id": "srcDot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#7FC4F5|#7FC4F5",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "身份点(card-design-system §2):直径 5pt、卡名左侧、间距 9pt。天空卡底恒深,故明暗两档同取深色值 #7FC4F5 —— 与卡上白字 #FFFFFF|#FFFFFF 同规。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-71pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${city},--)]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "id": "ttl"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-54pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "40pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      },
      {
        "_note": "拿不到昨天**且** 12 小时无雨(tipKey=na)→ 结论带没话说,就把今日高低温**提上来占住那条带**,整张卡退回改版前的信息量。\n⚠️ 不这么做的话结论带只是一条空槽,读起来像版式坏了而不像「这次没有结论」——而 §7 不许拿一句「今天和昨天差不多」去填它(那句只有真比过两天才成立)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${tipKey},na)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "34pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.high} $[findNotEmpty::(${hi},--)]°   ${@i18n.low} $[findNotEmpty::(${lo},--)]°",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "结论行按 .df 的 `tipKey` 分档,**只画命中的那一条**(优先级已在数据层排完,渲染层不再判)。\n⚠️ `na` 档(拿不到昨天且 12 小时无雨)**整行不画** —— 这条带子宁可空着,也不能填一句「今天和昨天差不多」:那句话只有在真比过两天时才成立(标准 §7)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${tipKey},rain_now)]"
        },
        "react": [
